cart_pole/
----------

Original work of Meta Platforms, Inc. and affiliates, licensed under the CC-BY-4.0 terms in
LICENSE. OpenAI Gym's cart-pole environment is defined in Python and ships no model file, so no
upstream asset is incorporated here; the geometry, kinematics, and dynamics were authored at Meta
to reproduce the behavior of that environment. The scene description calling it a replica of the
Gymnasium example refers to that behavior, not to a transcribed model file.
